    {
      "id": "2123103441396310178",
      "text": "If you are wondering what’s  going on with all the platform outages, cyber disruptions, and digital communication breakdowns,…and wondering why they are all happening now…then now would be a good time to familiarize yourself with the U.S. Genesis Mission.",
      "author": "SantiagoAuFund",
      "handle": "SantiagoAuFund",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-18T17:18:00+00:00",
      "createdAtMs": 1795022280000,
      "likes": 480,
      "retweets": 47,
      "url": "https://x.com/SantiagoAuFund/status/2123103441396310178",
      "avatar": null,
      "slot": "engagement",
      "slot_order": 6,
      "engagementScore": 527,
      "views": 49508,
      "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXbeT2HacAAYO7F.png",
      "media_alt": "Attached post media"
    },
    {
      "id": "2122957809180672180",
      "text": "We must be very close to a bottom now. Investors are starting to get real nervous. \n\nWe have always seen this after serious corrections. \n\nGreed at the top, fear at the bottom. \n\nThe cycle has been the same for centuries",
      "author": "wmiddelkoop",
      "handle": "wmiddelkoop",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-18T07:39:19+00:00",
      "createdAtMs": 1794987559000,
      "likes": 178,
      "retweets": 11,
      "url": "https://x.com/wmiddelkoop/status/2122957809180672180",
      "avatar": null,
      "slot": "engagement",
      "slot_order": 7,
      "engagementScore": 189,
      "views": 5343,
      "media_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXZBmk7XEAAEJou.jpg",
      "media_alt": "Attached post media"
    },
    {
      "id": "2123108213973213339",
      "text": "Many of the things I’m proudest of in life would have been difficult or impossible to accomplish without a large audience. For that, I owe every one of my readers and listeners a huge debt of gratitude.\n\nUsing fame as a lever, however, can be tricky.\n\nFirst off, what type of “fame” do you want? In concrete terms, what would “successful” look like and over what period of time? From 0–100%, how confident are you that you can convert exposure to income? \n\nIf more than 0%, what evidence do you have to suggest that your strategy will work? \n\nDo you have a plan for becoming unfamous if you don’t like it?\n\nDuring my college years, one of my dorm mate’s dads was a famous Hollywood producer. He once said to me, “You want everyone to know your name and no one to know your face.”",
